that we're tired of attack
between politicians.

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:12.078 line:92%
It didn't quite seem fair to m

00:00:12.078 --> 00:00:14.214 align:start size:94% position:6%
to describe that as attack
between politicians.

00:00:14.214 --> 00:00:17.350
Elijah Cummings doing his jo
on the Oversight Committee

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:19.786 align:start size:94% position:6%
