00:00:34.701 --> 00:00:36.036 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
and all the attacks

00:00:36.036 --> 00:00:38.338 align:start size:94% position:6%
and this politics
that's infecting America

00:00:38.338 --> 00:00:39.439 line:92%
and that's making it impossibl

00:00:39.439 --> 00:00:40.940 align:start size:94% position:6%
for us to get anything don
