00:01:02.862 --> 00:01:04.531 line:92%
That's what America wants.

00:01:04.531 --> 00:01:07.300 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I agree. I do agree.
There is that --

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:08.735 line:92%
And, again, I don't want to sa

00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:11.871 align:start size:94% position:6%
that politics wasn't divisiv
