Regardless of whether

00:02:17.837 --> 00:02:18.972 line:92%
they're Republican or Democrat

00:02:18.972 --> 00:02:20.473 align:start size:94% position:6%
they want all this nonsens
to stop,

00:02:20.473 --> 00:02:23.209 align:start size:94% position:6%
and they want us to just
sit down and figure out a wa

00:02:23.209 --> 00:02:25.778 align:start size:94% position:6%
